<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Shipping Note / Boat Note - EXP.3a</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 10mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #000; }
  .page { width: 190mm; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 2mm; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; }
  .note { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(24, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid #000; border-left: 1px solid #000; }
  .box { border-right: 1px solid #000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding: 1mm 1.5mm; min-height: 9mm; }
  .box .label { display: block; font-size: 6.5pt; margin-bottom: 0.5mm; }
  .box .value { display: block; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-line; }
  .box.tall { min-height: 55mm; }
  .box.official { outline: 2px solid #000; outline-offset: -2px; }
  .box.text { font-size: 7pt; }
  .num { text-align: right; }
  .sign { margin-top: 6mm; border-top: 1px dotted #000; font-size: 6.5pt; }
  .charges { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 7pt; }
  .charges th, .charges td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 0.5mm 1mm; }
  .charges th { font-weight: normal; font-size: 6.5pt; }
  .charges td.num { font-weight: bold; }
  .containers { margin: 2mm 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-weight: bold; }
  .footer { margin-top: 1.5mm; font-size: 6.5pt; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .hint { margin: 4mm auto; width: 190mm; padding: 2mm 3mm; border: 1px solid #999; background: #f4f4f4; font-size: 10pt; }
  @media screen {
    body { background: #e5e5e5; padding-bottom: 8mm; }
    .page { background: #fff; padding: 10mm; width: 210mm; box-shadow: 0 0 3mm rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); }
  }
  @media print {
    .hint { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p class="hint">To print this Boat Note or save it as a PDF, press Ctrl+P (&#8984;P on a Mac).</p>
<div class="page">
  <h1>SHIPPING NOTE / BOAT NOTE - EXP.3a</h1>
  <div class="note">
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 13; grid-row: span 2;">
      <span class="label">1. Shipper (Name and Address)</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.shipper }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 13 / 19;"><span class="label">9. Customs Entry No.</span></div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 19 / 25;"><span class="label">10. SN / (B/L) No.</span></div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 13 / 19;">
      <span class="label">11. Exporter's Registration No.</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.exporters_registration_no }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 19 / 25;"><span class="label">12. SLPA No.</span></div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 13;">
      <span class="label">2. Consignee (Name and Address)</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.consignee }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 13 / 25;">
      <span class="label">13. Name of Shipping Line / MTO</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.name_of_shipping_line }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 13;">
      <span class="label">3. Notify Address</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.notifying_address }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 13 / 25;">
      <span class="label">14.(a) Place of Acceptance</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.place_of_acceptance }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 7;">
      <span class="label">4. Voyage No. / Date</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.voyage_no_date }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 7 / 13;">
      <span class="label">5. Warehouse No.</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.warehouse_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 13 / 25;">
      <span class="label">14.(b) Place of Delivery</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.place_of_delivery }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 7;">
      <span class="label">6. Vessel</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.vessel }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 7 / 13;">
      <span class="label">7. Port of Loading</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.port_of_loading }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box text" style="grid-column: 13 / 25; grid-row: span 2;">
      The company preparing this note declares that to the best of their belief, the goods have been
      accurately described, their quantities, weights and measurements are correct and at the time of
      dispatch they were in good order and condition.
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 7;">
      <span class="label">8. Port of Discharge</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.port_of_discharge }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 7 / 10;">
      <span class="label">Vessel Op. Code</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.vessel_op_code }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 10 / 13;">
      <span class="label">Cont. Op. Code</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.cont_op_code }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box tall" style="grid-column: 1 / 7; grid-row: span 2;">
      <span class="label">15. Marks &amp; Nos. / Container Nos.</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.marks_nos_container_no }}</span>
      <ul class="containers">
        {{ range .boat_note.containers }}<li>{{ .container_number }} &middot; Seal {{ .customs_seal_no }} &middot; CDN {{ .cdn_number }}</li>{{ end }}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="box tall" style="grid-column: 7 / 11; grid-row: span 2;">
      <span class="label">16. Number &amp; Kind of Pkgs.</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.number_of_packages }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box tall" style="grid-column: 11 / 16; grid-row: span 2;">
      <span class="label">17. Description of Goods</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.description_of_goods }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box tall" style="grid-column: 16 / 19; grid-row: span 2;">
      <span class="label">18. CCCN No.</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.cccn_no }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 19 / 22;">
      <span class="label">19.(a) Gross Wt. (kg.)</span>
      <span class="value num">{{ decimal .boat_note.gross_mass 3 }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 22 / 25; grid-row: span 2;">
      <span class="label">20.(a) Cube M3</span>
      <span class="value num">{{ decimal .boat_note.cube_m3 3 }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 19 / 22;">
      <span class="label">19.(b) Net Wt. (kg.)</span>
      <span class="value num">{{ decimal .boat_note.net_mass 3 }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 16; grid-row: span 2;"></div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 16 / 19;"><span class="label">19.(c) Short Shipped</span></div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 19 / 22;"><span class="label">19.(d) Gross Wt. (kg)</span></div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 22 / 25;"><span class="label">20.(b) Cube m3</span></div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 16 / 19;"><span class="label">19.(e) Shipped</span></div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 19 / 22;"><span class="label">19.(f)</span></div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 22 / 25;"><span class="label">20.(c)</span></div>

    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 1 / 9;">
      <span class="label">21. For SLPA Use</span>
      <div class="sign">Date &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Signature</div>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 9 / 16;">
      <span class="label">23. Shipping Agent</span>
      <div class="sign">Date &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Signature</div>
    </div>
    <div class="box official text" style="grid-column: 16 / 25;">
      Received on board ............ number of packages / containers trailer in apparent good order and condition.
      <span class="label">28. SLPA Supervising Officer</span>
      <div class="sign">Date &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Signature</div>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 1 / 9; grid-row: span 5;">
      <span class="label">22.</span>
      <table class="charges">
        <tr><th></th><th>Estimated Amount Rs.</th><th>Final Amount Rs.</th></tr>
        {{ with .boat_note.section_22 }}
        <tr><td>a. Wharfage</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .wharfage.estimated_amount 2 }}</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .wharfage.final_amount 2 }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>b. Less FCL Rebate</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .less_fcl_rebate.estimated_amount 2 }}</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .less_fcl_rebate.final_amount 2 }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>c. Wharfage payable</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .wharfage_payable.estimated_amount 2 }}</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .wharfage_payable.final_amount 2 }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>d. Harbour Dues</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .harbour_dues.estimated_amount 2 }}</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .harbour_dues.final_amount 2 }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>e. Palletising / pre-warehousing charges</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .pre_warehousing_charges.estimated_amount 2 }}</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .pre_warehousing_charges.final_amount 2 }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>f. Fork-lift charges</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .fork_lift_charges.estimated_amount 2 }}</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .fork_lift_charges.final_amount 2 }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>g. Total</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .total.estimated_amount 2 }}</td><td class="num">{{ decimal .total.final_amount 2 }}</td></tr>
        {{ end }}
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 9 / 16;">
      <span class="label">24. For Customs Use</span>
      <div class="sign">Date &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Signature</div>
    </div>
    <div class="box official" style="grid-column: 16 / 25;">
      <span class="label">29. Chief Officer</span>
      <div class="sign">Date &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Signature</div>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 9 / 16;">
      <span class="label">25.(a) Status of Container (FCL / LCL)</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.status_of_container }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box text" style="grid-column: 16 / 25;">
      Please receive for shipment the goods described above subject to your published regulations &amp;
      conditions (including those as to liability).
      <span class="label">30. Name of Company Preparing the Note</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.name_of_company_preparing_this_note }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 9 / 16;">
      <span class="label">25.(b) Freight payable at</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.freight_payable_at }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 16 / 25;">
      <span class="label">31. Name of Declarant</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.name_of_declarant }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 9 / 16;">
      <span class="label">26. Number of Original Bs/L *</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.number_of_original_bs_l }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 16 / 25;">
      <span class="label">32. Telephone No.</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.telephone_no }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 9 / 16;">
      <span class="label">27. Please debit our C/A No. with charges payable</span>
      <span class="value">{{ .boat_note.debit_our_ca_no_with_charges_payable }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="grid-column: 16 / 25;">
      <span class="label">33. Signature of Declarant</span>
      <div class="sign">Authorized Signatory: <b>{{ .boat_note.authorized_signatory }}</b></div>
      <span class="label">Date: <b>{{ date .boat_note.declaration_date "2006-01-02" "02/01/2006" }}</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <span>* Need to appear only on the first THREE copies submitted to shipping company.</span>
    <span>DARK CAGES FOR OFFICIAL USE ONLY.</span>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
